# Docs

- Index lives in `docs/README.md`. Link new docs from there.
- `CURRENT_STATE.md` is the as-built map. Update it when a phase ships.
- Do not duplicate PRD behavior in three places. Point to PRD § or Identity loops.
- Never put Appendix A hungers in README, DEPLOY, or user-facing copy examples beyond “do not ship these words.”
